  "why": [
    "The worked example of the whole module: one product, three supply documents and four",
    "demand lines, drawn first-come by date across one ownership group (BB spans BRW and MWH).",
    "",
    "A takes the on hand at its date. B empties what is left and waits: the SPO that lands on",
    "15 Sep clears its shortfall FIRST, before any later line draws, so B ends covered and LATE.",
    "C then finds 10 of that SPO in time and is short 30 until the PO lands on 20 Oct, which",
    "clears its shortfall the same way - C is late too. D draws what is left of the PO at its",
    "own date and is short 130, with nothing behind it.",
    "",
    "An earlier line's open shortfall outranks a later line's in-time draw, which is what makes",
    "this first-come BY REQUIRED DATE rather than first-come by arrival."
